<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"># cmp %rbx, %rax 临时计算 rax - rbx。</span></span>
